<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5945" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφι-μάχομαι</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, 
			Ep.
		 Verb, only pres and impf., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
			<i>fight round:</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> c. acc., <i>assail,
				besiege,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἴλιον ἀμφεμάχοντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					6.461
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τρώων πόλιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					9.412
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στρατόν</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				16.73
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. gen.,
				<i>fight for,</i> as for a prize, of defenders and assallants, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τείχεος ἀμφεμάχοντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					15.391
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νέκυος δὲ δὴ ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					18.20
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χώρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					527.151
				</span></i>
			 (Dreros, <span class="entity">iii B. C.</span>).</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
    <div class="alpheios-lex-alph-source">From <u>
            <u>A Greek-English Lexicon</u>
